abstract: >
  Reproducibility code for constructing the MIMIC-IV external validation cohort,
  matching ECGs with NT-proBNP measurements within ±24 hours, generating
  standardized ECG images, extracting single-lead ECG (Lead I), and
  preprocessing data for deep learning-based BNP and NT-proBNP estimation.

